"person":"gongsuntao-p0069","role":"军将、领余众在船所","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-af990d6b6c015f930f27"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0068","role":"校尉、先遣诱吴","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-af990d6b6c015f930f27"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0069","role":"郎中令、先遣诱吴","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-af990d6b6c015f930f27"]},{"person":"mantian-p0003","role":"魏使者、拜渊为乐浪公；至住学馆中、大怖、还洛言状","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-450019c87c19652b684e","gongsuntao-q-53fdc8ca1012e256aba3"]},{"person":"gongsuntao-p0066","role":"魏使者、同拜渊；同住学馆、大怖还洛言状","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-450019c87c19652b684e","gongsuntao-q-53fdc8ca1012e256aba3"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":233,"label":"青龙元年十二月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y233","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o030","basis":"青龙元年十二月"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o036a-q","mingdi-q-o030","mingdi-q-o037","mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o036a-q","source_order":[3,217,"O036a"],"order":828}],"persons":[{"id":"gongsuntao-p0001","name":"万泰","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-af990d6b6c015f930f27"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"gongsuntao-q-0d33a544103290c4fdc2","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-34ca3fec9b802239e28e","layer":"original","quote":"使者至，渊设甲兵为军阵，出见使者；又数对国中宾客出恶言","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-300d73ca9e9fa45a3e3a","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-6c1a02548b17f7317c2e","layer":"original","quote":"渊亦恐权远不可恃，且贪货物〖5〗；诱致其使，悉斩送弥、晏等首","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":41,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-450019c87c19652b684e","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-caaadaeaef77c1527927","layer":"pei","quote":"魏遣使者傅容、聂夔，拜渊为乐浪公","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bd15304ac108864907ba","start":10,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-5142fa488a5a72920ad6","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-6c1a02548b17f7317c2e","layer":"original","quote":"权遣使张弥、许晏等，赍金玉珍宝，立渊为燕王","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":19,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-53fdc8ca1012e256aba3","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-caaadaeaef77c1527927","layer":"pei","quote":"渊计吏从洛阳还，语渊曰：‘使者左骏伯，使皆择勇力者，非凡人也！’渊由是疑怖。容、夔至，住学馆中。渊先以步骑围之，乃入受拜。容、夔大怖，由是还洛言状","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":227,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bd15304ac108864907ba","start":27,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-75b8a8597115fe3b632e","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-6c1a02548b17f7317c2e","layer":"original","quote":"明帝于是拜渊大司马，封乐浪公，持节、领郡如故","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":75,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-af990d6b6c015f930f27","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-c385fdb879704d169d8a","layer":"pei","quote":"臣前遣校尉宿舒、郎中令孙综，甘言厚礼，以诱吴贼。幸赖天道福助大魏，使此贼虏暗然迷惑；违戾群下，不从众谏；承信臣言，远遣船使；多将士卒，来致封拜。臣之所执，得如本志；虽忧罪衅，私怀幸甚。贼众本号‘万人’，舒、综伺察，可七八千人。到沓津，伪使者张弥、许晏，与中郎将万泰、校尉裴潜，将吏兵四百余人，赍文书、命服、什物，下到臣郡。泰、潜别赍致遣货物，欲因市马。军将贺达、虞咨，领余众在船所。臣本欲须凉节乃取弥等；而弥等人兵众多，见臣不便承受吴命，意有猜疑；惧其先作，变态妄生：即进兵围取，斩弥、晏、泰、潜等首级。其吏从兵众，皆士伍小人，给使东西，不得自由；面缚乞降，不忍诛杀，辄听纳受，徙充边城","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":221,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-14d174739835bc97c008","start":13,"end":306,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o036a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-6ff54fbfca62786685fb","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，公孙渊斩送孙权所遣使张弥、许晏首〖20〗；以渊为大司马、乐浪公。﹝三﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o030","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-cb99fef1996d806deb1c","layer":"original","quote":"青龙元年春正月，甲申〖1〗，青龙现郏之摩陂井中〖2〗。二月，丁酉〖3〗，幸摩陂观龙。于是改年，改摩陂为龙陂。赐男子爵，人二级；鳏寡孤独。无出今年租赋。三月，甲子〖4〗，诏公卿举贤良、笃行之士。各一人。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-2cdad682994e598680a1","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-e3933b3cde655110e1e9","layer":"original","quote":"后渊果斩送权使张弥等首","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":347,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":109,"end":120,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
